      { "block_id": "def-vfd", "kind": "paragraph", "text": "变频驱动器（Variable Frequency Drive，VFD）是指通过改变电源频率调节电机转速的装置。", "locator": { "scheme": "paragraph", "value": "5.1", "page": 5 } },

